        "body": "Seagate Technology Holdings plc describes itself as a leader in mass-capacity data storage. According to its website, the company has delivered more than four billion terabytes of capacity over the past four decades. It says it makes storage that scales and brings trust and integrity to innovations that depend on data.\n\nThe company's site positions Seagate around AI-related data growth. It states that AI is accelerating data growth and reshaping storage requirements, and that Seagate is optimizing storage for AI with capacity increases intended to support efficient data center architecture and buildout.\n\nSeagate Technology Holdings plc is a for-profit public company headquartered in Singapore. It trades under the ticker STX and has SEC CIK number 0001137789. There are no litigation cases or MCP servers associated with the company.",
